is childhood friends and best friends with Artesia, who is the same age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a bright and outgoing personality, and is attached to Vasileus like a father."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The possessor of the Artifact, which shoots lightning arrows from a lightning bow."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At Sephiroth, she specializes in the research of , and serves as Theodore's assistant in the project."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c162099"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/440acf6a91b491447912c1d8696a01d1a9be272b7f8336cbdae2d585df6857d2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c1bf44aeec9f62fdaa0c5528966f70fbb7dd440222157c825b287c17b04f4ae.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石見 舞菜香","creatorId":"vndb:s17263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17263","name":"石見 舞菜香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98815","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c162100","characterName":"ヴァシレウス･ラリウス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c162100"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァシレウス･ラリウス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"121"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"183"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The current head of the historic and Artesia's uncle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is extremely serious and has a strong sense of responsibility, but also possesses a ruthlessness that makes him willing to sacrifice anything for the sake of his convictions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He adopted the young Theodore and Chrisneia, gave them the surname Stratos, and instilled martial arts and education in them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At Sephiroth, he serves as the person in charge of the project, providing full backup for Theodor."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c162100"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d55453d99a07a36f152f057328a5377c84ff3dc237b229bf6d94b724882a1052.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64e1dfeb73c927854675403ebc2a10ca7f4b6feb7219515aed148de08b0b619c.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大塚 芳忠","creatorId":"vndb:s1358","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1358","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1358","name":"大塚 芳忠","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98814","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c171484","characterName":"アルテシア･ラリウス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c171484"},"originalCharacterName":"アルテシア･ラリウス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1115"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young lady of the Larius family who is hospitalized in Sephirot. Her nickname is \"Lusha.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because she manifested and acquired the magic of 《Healing》 in her early childhood, she has been receiving treatment at Sephirot for a long time in order to analyze it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes jokes and is usually messing around, so she often troubles the staff at Sephirot, but because she is cheerful and always smiling, they cannot bring themselves to hate her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has known Theodore since childhood and, without caring what others think, she publicly declares that \"I will marry Teo in the future,\" but he always skillfully deflects her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c171484"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6a2699d83cf63c5ff7c59c987a1d41047d9018815b38b1d7236d97e11fbcda83.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c5add2e0444df3be105d7df8498ab583974d3f6e4db6597c45e63c17d002195.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"悠木 碧","creatorId":"vndb:s1321","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1321","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1321","name":"悠木 碧","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98813","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:403","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:403","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:403","name":"ぱれっと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:39996:403","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p10","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p10","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p10","name":"ぱれっと","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:137669:v52407","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":[],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
